      "comment": "BEST YET (1) has an excellent record over this journey having never missed the placings in seven starts, including five wins and two placings. Comes off a (19.31) win last time, scoring by 9 lengths in a Grade 5 over 352m at this track. Expected to go close. MCCLUGGAGE (2) was a winner two back when leading throughout but drifted back latest and safely held when 8th and beaten 6 lengths at this track (26.12). Has ability and can atone. SUMMER'S SCRUB (6) is a quick dog who thrives over the short dashes. Was a strong winner last time (19.29) over 352m at this track in a Grade 1/2. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won nine of 14 tries. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Expected to measure up again. ROXY CAMBLA (5) recorded a 0.8 lengths win (29.97) in a Grade 5 last time at Q Parklands. Has two wins already from this draw.",
